<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LeafMash ডাউনলোড করুন — ভূগোল ও পরিবেশ বিভাগ</title>
<meta name="description" content="LeafMash — ভূগোল ও পরিবেশ বিভাগের নিজস্ব অ্যাপ। ওয়াল, নোট-শিট, রুটিন, ক্লাসমেট ডিরেক্টরি আর চ্যাট, সবকিছু একখানে।">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0f2e1d">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+Bengali:wght@400;600;700&family=Hind+Siliguri:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --forest-950:#0b2015;
  --forest-900:#0f2e1d;
  --forest-800:#143a25;
  --forest-700:#1a4c30;
  --forest-600:#226241;
  --forest-500:#2d7a51;
  --forest-200:#cfe0d1;
  --forest-100:#e2ece3;
  --forest-50:#f0f5f0;
  --paper:#f7f3e8;
  --paper-deep:#efe8d6;
  --ink:#17241c;
  --ink-soft:#4b5b4c;
  --ink-faint:#8b9686;
  --line:#e0dac4;
  --amber:#b9812a;
  --amber-deep:#8a5f1c;
  --shadow-soft: 0 1px 2px rgba(23,36,28,.06), 0 10px 30px rgba(23,36,28,.08);
  --shadow-lift: 0 20px 50px rgba(11,32,21,.22);
  --serif: "Noto Serif Bengali","Fraunces",serif;
  --sans: "Hind Siliguri","Inter",sans-serif;
}
* { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
html { scroll-behavior:smooth; }
body {
  font-family:var(--sans);
  color:var(--ink);
  background:var(--paper);
  line-height:1.6;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
img,svg { display:block; max-width:100%; }
a { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
ul { list-style:none; }
.wrap { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * { animation-duration:.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:.001ms !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important; }
}
:focus-visible { outline:3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset:3px; }

.paper-texture {
  position:fixed; inset:0; pointer-events:none; z-index:0;
  background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(23,36,28,.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size:22px 22px;
  opacity:.7;
}

.site-nav {
  position:sticky; top:0; z-index:40;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  padding:16px 24px;
  background:rgba(247,243,232,.86);
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
.brand-mark {
  width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:11px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-600), var(--forest-900));
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);
}
.brand-name {
  font-family:"Fraunces", var(--serif);
  font-weight:600; font-size:1.18rem; letter-spacing:.01em;
  color:var(--forest-900);
}
.nav-cta {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  padding:10px 20px; border-radius:999px;
  background:var(--forest-800); color:var(--forest-50);
  font-weight:600; font-size:.92rem;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);
  transition:transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
}
.nav-cta:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift); }

.hero {
  position:relative;
  padding:64px 0 40px;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.contour-bg {
  position:absolute; inset:-10% -10% auto -10%; height:130%;
  z-index:0; opacity:.55;
  transform:translate3d(0,0,0);
}
.hero-inner {
  position:relative; z-index:1;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:48px;
  align-items:center;
}
@media (min-width:960px) {
  .hero-inner { grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr; gap:24px; }
}
.hero-copy h1 {
  font-family:var(--serif);
  font-weight:700;
  font-size:clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
  line-height:1.22;
  color:var(--forest-950);
  max-width:14ch;
}
.hero-copy p.lede {
  margin-top:20px;
  font-size:1.08rem;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
  max-width:46ch;
}
.hero-actions {
  margin-top:32px;
  display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:16px;
}
.btn-primary {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  padding:15px 26px; border-radius:14px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-600), var(--forest-900));
  color:#fff; font-weight:600; font-size:1rem;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);
  transition:transform .2s ease;
}
.btn-primary:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); }
.btn-primary svg { flex-shrink:0; }
.btn-secondary {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  padding:14px 6px; font-weight:600; font-size:.98rem;
  color:var(--forest-800);
  border-bottom:2px solid var(--forest-200);
  transition:border-color .2s ease;
}
.btn-secondary:hover { border-color:var(--forest-600); }
.hero-meta {
  margin-top:8px;
  font-family:"Inter",var(--sans);
  font-size:.82rem; color:var(--ink-faint);
}
.hero-trust {
  margin-top:36px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
}
.hero-trust svg { flex-shrink:0; color:var(--forest-600); }

.phone-stage {
  position:relative;
  display:flex; justify-content:center;
}
.leaf-blob {
  position:absolute;
  width:120%; height:120%;
  top:-10%; left:-10%;
  z-index:0;
  color:var(--forest-100);
  opacity:.9;
}
.phone {
  position:relative; z-index:1;
  width:270px; height:552px;
  border-radius:42px;
  background:var(--forest-950);
  padding:14px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);
  transform:rotate(-2deg);
  transition:transform .6s ease;
}
.phone:hover { transform:rotate(0deg); }
.phone-screen {
  width:100%; height:100%;
  border-radius:30px;
  background:var(--paper);
  overflow:hidden;
  position:relative;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column;
}
.phone-notch {
  position:absolute; top:0; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
  width:96px; height:22px; background:var(--forest-950);
  border-radius:0 0 16px 16px; z-index:5;
}
.phone-topbar {
  padding:30px 18px 14px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-600), var(--forest-900));
  color:#fff;
}
.phone-topbar .ptitle { font-family:var(--serif); font-weight:700; font-size:1rem; }
.phone-topbar .psub { font-size:.72rem; opacity:.75; margin-top:2px; }
.phone-body { padding:14px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; flex:1; }
.pcard {
  background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px;
  padding:12px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);
}
.pcard .pname { font-weight:700; font-size:.78rem; color:var(--forest-800); }
.pcard .ptext { font-size:.74rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:4px; line-height:1.5; }
.pcard.chat { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; background:transparent; border:none; box-shadow:none; padding:0; }
.bubble { max-width:78%; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:14px; font-size:.74rem; }
.bubble.in { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); align-self:flex-start; border-bottom-left-radius:4px; }
.bubble.out { background:var(--forest-600); color:#fff; align-self:flex-end; border-bottom-right-radius:4px; }

.section-head {
  max-width:56ch;
  margin:0 auto 56px;
  text-align:center;
}
.section-head h2 {
  font-family:var(--serif); font-weight:700;
  font-size:clamp(1.7rem, 3.4vw, 2.3rem);
  color:var(--forest-950);
}
.section-head p { margin-top:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:1.02rem; }

.features { padding:96px 0 40px; position:relative; }
.feature-row {
  position:relative;
  max-width:820px; margin:0 auto;
}
.vein {
  position:absolute; left:34px; top:0; bottom:0; width:2px;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--forest-200) 0 6px, transparent 6px 12px);
}
@media (min-width:720px) { .vein { left:50%; transform:translateX(-1px); } }
.feature {
  position:relative;
  display:flex; gap:20px; align-items:flex-start;
  padding:22px 0 22px 66px;
}
@media (min-width:720px) {
  .feature { width:50%; padding:26px 0; }
  .feature:nth-child(odd) { padding-right:52px; padding-left:0; text-align:right; flex-direction:row-reverse; }
  .feature:nth-child(even) { padding-left:52px; margin-left:50%; }
}
.feature-icon {
  flex-shrink:0; width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:16px;
  background:var(--forest-50); border:1px solid var(--forest-100);
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  color:var(--forest-700);
  position:relative; z-index:1;
}
@media (min-width:720px) {
  .feature:nth-child(odd) .feature-icon { order:2; }
}
.feature h3 {
  font-family:var(--serif); font-weight:700; font-size:1.12rem; color:var(--forest-900);
}
.feature p { margin-top:6px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:.94rem; max-width:38ch; }
@media (min-width:720px) {
  .feature:nth-child(odd) p { margin-left:auto; }
}

.screens {
  padding:40px 0 100px;
}
.screens-strip {
  display:flex; gap:20px; overflow-x:auto; padding:8px 24px 24px;
  scroll-snap-type:x proximity;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
}
.screens-strip::-webkit-scrollbar { height:6px; }
.screens-strip::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background:var(--forest-200); border-radius:8px; }
.screen-card {
  scroll-snap-align:center;
  flex-shrink:0; width:200px;
}
.screen-card figure { border-radius:22px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft); border:1px solid var(--line); }
.screen-card figcaption { margin-top:12px; font-weight:600; font-size:.88rem; color:var(--forest-900); text-align:center; }
.mini-shot { height:400px; background:var(--paper); display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
.mini-topbar { background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-600), var(--forest-900)); height:64px; }
.mini-body { flex:1; padding:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
.mini-line { height:10px; border-radius:5px; background:var(--forest-100); }
.mini-line.short { width:60%; }
.mini-card { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; height:54px; }

.access {
  padding:20px 0 100px;
}
.access-card {
  max-width:920px; margin:0 auto;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px;
  background:var(--forest-950); color:var(--forest-50);
  border-radius:28px; padding:42px 32px;
  position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}
@media (min-width:760px) { .access-card { grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr; align-items:center; padding:52px; } }
.access-card h2 { font-family:var(--serif); font-weight:700; font-size:1.7rem; }
.access-card p { margin-top:14px; color:rgba(240,245,240,.78); font-size:.98rem; max-width:44ch; }
.access-badge {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  margin-top:22px; padding:10px 16px; border-radius:12px;
  background:rgba(240,245,240,.08); border:1px solid rgba(240,245,240,.18);
  font-size:.86rem; color:var(--forest-100);
}
.access-list { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }
.access-item {
  display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;
  padding:16px; border-radius:16px;
  background:rgba(240,245,240,.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(240,245,240,.12);
}
.access-item svg { flex-shrink:0; color:var(--amber); margin-top:2px; }
.access-item span { font-size:.88rem; color:var(--forest-100); }

.download {
  padding:20px 24px 110px;
}
.download-band {
  max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto;
  border-radius:32px;
  padding:64px 40px;
  text-align:center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 160% at 15% -20%, rgba(185,129,42,.35) 0%, transparent 45%),
    linear-gradient(160deg, var(--forest-700), var(--forest-950));
  color:#fff;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.download-band h2 {
  font-family:var(--serif); font-weight:700;
  font-size:clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
}
.download-band p { margin:16px auto 0; max-width:48ch; color:rgba(240,245,240,.8); }
.download-actions { margin-top:34px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; justify-content:center; }
.btn-light {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  padding:16px 28px; border-radius:14px;
  background:#fff; color:var(--forest-900); font-weight:700; font-size:1.02rem;
  box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
  transition:transform .2s ease;
}
.btn-light:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); }
.download-fine { margin-top:20px; font-family:"Inter",var(--sans); font-size:.78rem; color:rgba(240,245,240,.55); }

.site-footer {
  padding:36px 24px 48px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
}
.footer-inner {
  max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto;
  display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px;
}
.footer-brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; color:var(--forest-800); font-weight:600; }
.footer-fine { font-size:.82rem; color:var(--ink-faint); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="paper-texture"></div>

<header class="site-nav">
  <div class="brand">
    <span class="brand-mark">
      <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
        <path d="M4 14C4 8 9 4 20 4C20 15 16 20 10 20C7 20 5 18 4 14Z" fill="#e9f2ea"/>
        <path d="M5 19C9 15 13 11 19 5" stroke="#226241" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="brand-name">LeafMash</span>
  </div>
  <a class="nav-cta" href="#download">
    ডাউনলোড করুন
  </a>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <svg class="contour-bg" viewBox="0 0 1200 800" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M-50 620 C 200 560, 350 700, 600 610 S 1050 520, 1250 600" stroke="#cfe0d1" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M-50 660 C 220 600, 380 730, 620 650 S 1060 560, 1250 640" stroke="#cfe0d1" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M-50 700 C 240 650, 400 760, 640 690 S 1080 610, 1250 680" stroke="#dfeadf" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M-50 100 C 180 60, 320 150, 560 90 S 980 40, 1250 110" stroke="#e2ece3" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M-50 140 C 200 100, 340 190, 580 130 S 1000 80, 1250 150" stroke="#e2ece3" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>বিভাগের সবাই, একসাথে একখানে</h1>
        <p class="lede">নোটিশ, নোট-শিট, রুটিন আর সহপাঠীদের সাথে যোগাযোগ — ভূগোল ও পরিবেশ বিভাগের নিজস্ব অ্যাপ, LeafMash। পুরনো গ্রুপ-চ্যাট আর ছড়ানো-ছিটানো ফাইলের দিন শেষ।</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="#download">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
              <path d="M12 3v12m0 0l-4.5-4.5M12 15l4.5-4.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <path d="M5 19h14" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
            Android অ্যাপ ডাউনলোড করুন
          </a>
          <a class="btn-secondary" href="#screens">
            স্ক্রিনশট দেখুন
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-meta">APK · সংস্করণ 2.8 · প্রায় 19 MB</p>
        <div class="hero-trust">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <span>শুধুমাত্র যশোর এম.এম. কলেজ, ভূগোল ও পরিবেশ বিভাগের শিক্ষার্থীদের জন্য</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="phone-stage">
        <svg class="leaf-blob" viewBox="0 0 400 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M60 380C10 260 40 100 200 40C300 180 340 340 220 440C160 470 100 450 60 380Z" fill="currentColor"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="phone">
          <div class="phone-notch"></div>
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="phone-topbar">
              <div class="ptitle">বিভাগীয় ওয়াল</div>
              <div class="psub">২য় বর্ষ · সাম্মানিক</div>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-body">
              <div class="pcard">
                <div class="pname">নোটিশ · রুটিন কমিটি</div>
                <div class="ptext">আগামীকাল ৩য় ক্লাস স্থগিত থাকবে, নতুন সময় শীঘ্রই জানানো হবে।</div>
              </div>
              <div class="pcard">
                <div class="pname">নোট শেয়ার · Physical Geography</div>
                <div class="ptext">চ্যাপ্টার ৪-এর হাতে লেখা নোট আপলোড করা হয়েছে।</div>
              </div>
              <div class="pcard chat">
                <div class="bubble in">আজকের ক্লাস কয়টায়?</div>
                <div class="bubble out">দুপুর ২টায়, রুম ৩০৫</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>অ্যাপে যা যা পাবেন</h2>
        <p>বিভাগের দরকারি সবকিছু এক জায়গায় গুছিয়ে রাখা — খোঁজাখুঁজির ঝামেলা ছাড়াই।</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="vein"></div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>বিভাগীয় ওয়াল</h3>
            <p>নোটিশ, ঘোষণা আর জরুরি আপডেট এক ফিডে — মিস হওয়ার সুযোগ নেই।</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 3h8l4 4v14H7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M10 12h6M10 16h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>নোট ও শিট</h3>
            <p>ক্লাস নোট আর শিট আপলোড, শেয়ার আর ডাউনলোড করুন সহপাঠীদের সাথে।</p>
          </div>
        </div>

